    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/43952d8e083999cdf9e85d2cd263eff7.poster.avif?t=1754765176\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/43952d8e083999cdf9e85d2cd263eff7.webm?t=1754765176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/43952d8e083999cdf9e85d2cd263eff7.mp4?t=1754765176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual Eclipse is a shortform dungeon crawler meant to be played over a weekend that resolves turn-based combat with trick-taking. Players will parry cards, turn the tide of battle with powerful Eclipse cards, and loot monsters to upgrade their decks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of three classes to explore mysterious dungeons, evade dangerous traps, uncover powerful treasure, and discover secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE TRICK-TAKING COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/c12f5b7adb01f40d6b227f3bdf567aef.poster.avif?t=1754765176\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/c12f5b7adb01f40d6b227f3bdf567aef.webm?t=1754765176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/c12f5b7adb01f40d6b227f3bdf567aef.mp4?t=1754765176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is resolved with trick-taking! Think of it like fencing with cards!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players and enemies have control of the win condition during combat, so every encounter offers strategic decisions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique combos encourage interesting choices and dynamic combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Change the tide of battle by switching the Moon and Sun with powerful Eclipse Cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Parry cards! A tactical choice that offers high risk, high reward opportunities.    </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR DECK, CRAFT CARDS, AND GROW STRONGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/39f54a212ef14724b06602bae4c4625b.poster.avif?t=1754765176\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/39f54a212ef14724b06602bae4c4625b.webm?t=1754765176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/39f54a212ef14724b06602bae4c4625b.mp4?t=1754765176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect new cards by defeating enemies and gain new powers by finding treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft cards that empower your build. Need a shield to go with that sword? Craft it! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gain powerful abilities and enhancements. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level up and specialize your class for a playstyle that matches your playstyle. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/43952d8e083999cdf9e85d2cd263eff7.poster.avif?t=1754765176\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/43952d8e083999cdf9e85d2cd263eff7.webm?t=1754765176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/43952d8e083999cdf9e85d2cd263eff7.mp4?t=1754765176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual Eclipse is a shortform dungeon crawler meant to be played over a weekend that resolves turn-based combat with trick-taking. Players will parry cards, turn the tide of battle with powerful Eclipse cards, and loot monsters to upgrade their decks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of three classes to explore mysterious dungeons, evade dangerous traps, uncover powerful treasure, and discover secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE TRICK-TAKING COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/c12f5b7adb01f40d6b227f3bdf567aef.poster.avif?t=1754765176\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/c12f5b7adb01f40d6b227f3bdf567aef.webm?t=1754765176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/c12f5b7adb01f40d6b227f3bdf567aef.mp4?t=1754765176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is resolved with trick-taking! Think of it like fencing with cards!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players and enemies have control of the win condition during combat, so every encounter offers strategic decisions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique combos encourage interesting choices and dynamic combat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Change the tide of battle by switching the Moon and Sun with powerful Eclipse Cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Parry cards! A tactical choice that offers high risk, high reward opportunities.    </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR DECK, CRAFT CARDS, AND GROW STRONGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/39f54a212ef14724b06602bae4c4625b.poster.avif?t=1754765176\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/39f54a212ef14724b06602bae4c4625b.webm?t=1754765176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/39f54a212ef14724b06602bae4c4625b.mp4?t=1754765176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect new cards by defeating enemies and gain new powers by finding treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft cards that empower your build. Need a shield to go with that sword? Craft it! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gain powerful abilities and enhancements. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level up and specialize your class for a playstyle that matches your playstyle. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Delve into mysterious dungeons and discover a way to restore order to the cosmos in this trick-taking dungeon crawler. Evade traps, discover secrets, and strategize with unique trick-taking combat. Change the tide of battle with powerful eclipse cards, upgrade your deck, and parry cards!",
